{# Brand logo – three squares and the wordmark as one lockup, generated from
   the master artwork with the wordmark converted to outlines (no font
   dependency). The squares are the brand family, left to right in the order
   the brands came into being: purple for the employment career (this site),
   petrol for krausgebaut, papaya for krausgedruckt.
   Params: class (sizing), mono (single color via currentColor), aria_label.

   The wordmark binds to neutral-900, the squares to the brand tokens, so the
   lockup cannot drift from the palette. #}
